=2 Walkthrough
You must zone after completing {q:Middle Lands Investigation|Middle Lands Investigation|Middle Lands Investigation} before you are able to accept this quest.{br} Speak to {n:Anastase} and select the first option, "Must have more warp destinations!"
At this point, you must discover ten more {p:Geomagnetic Founts|Geomagnetic Fount} hidden throughout Vana'diel by using the hints provided upon asking Anastase about his predictions:
|^Location Name|Details
|**Abandoned Village{br}**A church standing in an abandoned village|{z:Davoi} (I-8) - On a ledge to your left right before the broken bridge going west. - (600 EXP)
|**Malediction{br}**Beyond a hall wrapped in curses|{z:Beadeaux} (G-7) - In the basement behind the first mute. - (600 EXP)
|**Faeries{br}**An abode of faeries worshipping a living god|{z:Castle Oztroja} (G-8) - Close to the entrance, behind the statue (you must go around). - (600 EXP)
|**City Ruins{br}**A city swallowed by the land|{z:Quicksand Caves} (F-7) - Take the (D-12) entrance from {z:Western Altepa Desert}. You will need a {k:Loadstone} or multiple persons to open the doors unless you're a Galka. - (750 EXP)
|**Grotto{br}**An eroded cave where space twists and turns|{z:Sea Serpent Grotto} (J-5) - Behind Mythril Door. - (750 EXP)
|**Shrine{br}**A temple where those who have lost darkness reside|{z:Temple of Uggalepih} (H-8) - Map Two - Located inside the hidden room, next to a potential coffer spawn location. (750 EXP) {br}{p:Unity Warp (125)|Category:Unity Concord} puts you closest to this one.
|**Forest{br}**Moss that glistens deep with a gigantic tree|{z:The Boyahda Tree} (D-4) - Map One - On a ledge north of the northern tree. - (900 EXP)
|**Urban Locale{br}**A city constructed by nomadic beastmen|{z:Oldton Movalpolos} (K-11) - Requires travelling through {z:Newton Movalpolos}. - (750 EXP) {br}While in {z:Oldton Movalpolos} travel to E-13, talk to {n:Twinkbrix}, and win a gamble against him to receive a {@k} {p:Shaft gate operating dial}. 10,000 gil gives the highest success rate - alternatively, trading 2,716 gil on Lightsday also gives the highest success rate. While owning the key item, trade 2,000 gil to teleport to Mineshaft 2716. Exit out of Mineshaft 2716 into {z:Newton Movalpolos} and travel to the furnace at K-8.{br} You will be heading south from here, if the fence/gate is restricting you from going south, you will need a {i:Firesand|Firesand|947} (drops from Moblin Roadman/Engineer). Trade the Firesand to the furnace to move the fence/gate.{br} Drop off at I/J-9 and continue running south. You will now be heading to E-9 (4 on the Map) and exit back into {z:Oldton Movalpolos}. The geomagnetic fount is on the left near the opening of the tunnel.
|**Belfry{br}**Another beautiful ring of a bell|{p:Riverne - Site B01} (C-10) - Requires two {i:Giant Scales|Giant Scale|1691}. - (900 EXP) {br}If you already have the HP for this zone, then you only need 1 Giant Scale and the Fount is much closer than the entrance.{br} If you don't have the HP, get it at the same time at E-8.
|**Darkness{br}**The farthest reaches of the blackest depths|{z:Castle Zvahl Keep} (H-8) - It is located in the middle of the first room. - (900 EXP)

After attuning the {k:Prototype attuner} to each of the 10 geomagnetic founts above, return to {n:Anastase} to complete the quest.
Note: if you have the quest {q:Granddaddy Dearest|Granddaddy Dearest|Granddaddy Dearest} open at the same time, {n:Anastase} will not complete this quest before you complete {q:Granddaddy Dearest|Granddaddy Dearest|Granddaddy Dearest}.
